{"Name":"Sembawang Drive EC","ShortName":"Sembawang Drive EC","Description":"Sembawang Drive EC has a land size of approximately 138,854 sqft and is expected to have 450 residential units. It is right next to Northoaks Primary School and has 3 other primary schools within 1km, ensuring a rich education for your children. It is expected to also be one of the more affordable ECs of recent times, especially when compared to those in Tampines.","StartUrl":"/","Display":"standalone","BackgroundColor":"#ffffff","ThemeColor":"#041e42","Orientation":"portrait","Icons":[{"Src":"https://rtdbookappointment.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/Bookappointment/Property/7d9be1c4-b5df-4865-a81b-1cf0b51e2858","Sizes":"192x192","Type":"image/png"},{"Src":"https://rtdbookappointment.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/Bookappointment/Property/7d9be1c4-b5df-4865-a81b-1cf0b51e2858","Sizes":"512x512","Type":"image/png"}]}